msgstr ""
"The user needs to manually configure the module to enter provisioning "
"mode."

#: 8c43eb056966462aa342d0220a6a8a1b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/RTL87XX/index.rst:532
msgid "请问BW16支持flash大小256Mbits么？"
msgstr "Does BW16 support 256 Mbits Flash size?"

#: 9412ad5750f74490a07d614c5b25c647
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/RTL87XX/index.rst:533
msgid "不支持，支持最大128Mbits"
msgstr "No. It supports a maximum of 128 Mbits."

#: 72bcd02f010f477c97f9a046aa4ce649
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/RTL87XX/index.rst:536
msgid "请问为何我BW16模组老是烧录失败？"
msgstr "Why does my BW16 module always fail to flash?"

#: 1bf5253930bf49f6b7bd7cdf5d3bf0e3
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/RTL87XX/index.rst:537
msgid "检查一下接的串口是否正确，需要接Log_TX以及Log_RX用于烧录固件，另外要设置模组进入烧录模式。通过普通串口判断模组是否进入烧录模式（hex显示下移植打印“15”则成功进入烧录模式）。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the connected UART is correct. You need to connect Log_TX "
"and Log_RX for firmware flashing, and also set the module to enter "
"flashing/download mode. You can use the normal UART to determine whether "
"the module has entered flashing mode (if “15” is printed in hex display "
"mode, it means the module has successfully entered flashing mode)."

#: 0e588dcbc508472c8f2cf3ed2a8760a7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/RTL87XX/index.rst:540
msgid "请问BW16模组要那个引脚与MCU连接？"
msgstr "Which pins of the BW16 module should be connected to the MCU?"

#: 79e0532d2e95408e90ab36dc6b9633e1
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/RTL87XX/index.rst:541
msgid "AT_RX以及AT_TX，开发板则接PB2_RX1以及PB1_TX1"
msgstr ""
"Use AT_RX and AT_TX. For the development board, connect to PB2_RX1 and "
"PB1_TX1."
